# RX 6600: two shots a frame apart at the newest save (the pair tells motion from difference), to compare the reflection and
# volumetric blurs between builds: vanilla's ISBlurCS (move ISBlurCS.hlsl out of the mod), FXC (-Env CS_SHADER_DXC=^$) and DXC
# (the default). Shots go to <log directory>/dclf-shots, named per run, so the commands come with -Env:
#   -Env 'CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=30:tgm;1500:dclf:shot=blur-<label>-a;1502:dclf:shot=blur-<label>-b;1600:qqq'
# tgm first: a wolf attacks the player at the newest save.
DXVK_FILTER_DEVICE_NAME=AMD Radeon RX 6600
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
